# Sources and provenance

This page is deliberately outside the story.

The Archaic Web combines original fiction with links to historical, scientific, technological and cultural resources. A linked resource does not inherit the epistemic status of the page that links to it.

## Internal source material

The first six reconstructed-memory pages are based on the ANI / Axel / Curtain / Green Ascent / Lattice / Signal story developed for Chess Atlas and its Future Infinite Board.

Development records may later be exposed as preserved archive material. Their original dates and provenance should be retained.

## External references

External historical, scientific and fictional influences must be cited here before public release. Copyrighted fictional universes are references and cultural precedents, not incorporated canon.
